# This file lists CVEs to ignore in Trivy scans
# Only add CVEs here when they cannot be fixed and have been reviewed for risk

# brace-expansion & ip-address — bundled in the global npm@12.0.1 CLI, not our package tree.
# Not fixable by us: `overrides` can't reach npm's internal bundle, and no npm release ships
# the patched versions yet. Low risk: build-time tooling, no untrusted input.
# Tracked: https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/9869, https://github.com/npm/cli/issues/9867
# Reviewed: 2026-08-25
CVE-2026-14257
