# msgpack & setuptools — vendored inside pip (pip/_vendor), not in Pipfile.lock or the app venv.
# Not fixable by us: needs a newer pip that refreshes its vendored copies. Confirmed not-affected
# upstream (pip vendors only setuptools' pkg_resources; msgpack issue is a dev-tool DoS).
# Tracked: https://github.com/pypa/pip/issues/14224
# Reviewed: 2026-08-25
